{
  "cited_article_id": "configure-online-appointment-booking",
  "reply": "Enable online booking (Settings > Patient Portal > Booking Rules) and then mark only the routine visit types as **Available Online** in Settings > Scheduling > Visit Types. Ensure non‑routine types are unchecked. Finally, under Settings > Schedule > Provider Availability, select the providers who should accept online requests. Only those providers with active schedules and the selected routine visit types will appear to patients."
}
